# The rates of value added tax of the Czech Republic, as Act 235/2004 sets
# them. Act 180/2026, in force from 1 January 2027, moves what falls under the
# reduced rate and leaves the rates as they are.
# Read by Trilobit\Core\Finance\TaxRateTemplates; see README.md, "Templates of
# rates of tax", for what each key means.

country: CZ
verifiedAt: 2026-11-27
sources:
	- https://www.zakonyprolidi.cz/cs/2004-235
	- https://www.zakonyprolidi.cz/cs/2026-180
rates:
	standard: {kind: standard, percent: 21, label: Standard rate}
	reduced: {kind: reduced, percent: 12, label: Reduced rate}
	zero: {kind: zero, percent: 0, label: 'Zero rate (books and the like)'}
